    "description": "Duskin Co., Ltd. engages in the environmental hygiene and food businesses in Japan and internationally. It is involved in the rental and sale of cleaning and hygiene products; leasing, sale, and cleaning of uniforms; sale of natural cosmetics and health foods products; and comprehensive event support. The company offers cleaning/beautification-related items such as mats, mops, cabinet towels, and air purifiers. The company provides professional cleaning; pest control and comprehensive hygiene management; home cleaning and helper; plant and flower upkeep; and home repair services comprising fixing scratches and dents, as well as emergency locksmith service; support services for seniors; and rental and sale of assisted-living products. In addition, it operates hamburger and donut shops, and pork cutlet restaurants. Duskin Co., Ltd. was incorporated in 1963 and is headquartered in Osaka, Japan."
